{
  "_comment": "TractorMixGenome LIMITED covariates. chroms and flare_vcfs must be parallel (same order). Smoke example uses chr21+chr22; for full autosomes run: python3 scripts/resolve_flare_uris.py --from-firecloud --autosomes --grm-chroms chr1 chr22. GRM stays small (chr1+chr22) — do not point grm_vcfs at all scan chroms.",
